# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` must NOT upload.
#
# This file exists for one load-bearing reason: without a .gcloudignore, gcloud
# falls back to .gitignore — and knowledge/ is deliberately gitignored (the
# corpus is private and stays out of the public repository) while still being
# REQUIRED at runtime. Deleting this file would make the next deploy silently
# ship an Elle with an empty knowledge base.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
dist
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
profile.md
Elle-Documentation.html
Elle-Documentation.pdf
voice-previews
course
docs
